<title>USA: Merchants Group Inc Q3 shr profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Merchants Group Inc Q3 shr profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>BUFFALO, N.Y. 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr     profit	   $0.06     loss	 $0.62</p>
<p> Net     profit	     197     loss	 1,996</p>
<p> Revs			27,047		   27,041</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   3,182		    3,219</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr     profit	   $0.66     loss	 $1.49</p>
<p> Net     profit	   2,114     loss	 4,801</p>
<p> Revs			81,527		   77,471</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   3,207		    3,218</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: 1995 Q3 includes increase in reserve for losses incurred in accident years before 1995 of about $3.8 million net of taxes, or $1.18 per share.</p>
<p>1996 Q3 include an increase of about $1.2 million net of taxes in reserve for losses, or about $0.38 per share.</p>
</text>
